    "title": "Allegations of AI Use in Nikon Competition Spark Controversy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Last week, Nikon Instruments Inc. declared the winners of the annual Nikon Small World in Motion contest, which celebrates films captured through microscopes. Ning Xu, an optical engineer at Tsinghua University, bagged first place for a video showing abnormal beating of cilia in the airway of a child with primary ciliary dyskinesia (PCD), a rare genetic disorder that affects respiratory function. Read full article",
